    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d463">

                <pb facs="0644" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg524"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Chargé
                    Brown.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-08-02"><hi rendition="#italic">August 2,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    dispatch No. 290 of the 12th ultimo, transmitting a copy of a note of the
                    Guatemalan foreign office expressing regret for the conduct of Judge Solis
                    towards Consul-General Winslow.</p>
                <p>The Department desires to express its satisfaction with your management of the
                    case and results secured.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
